---
const starLima = '/star-lima.svg';
const starSecondary = '/star-lima.svg';
---

<!-- BEGIN: Hero Section -->
<section
  class="relative min-h-[92vh] flex items-center pt-28 pb-20 overflow-hidden bg-brand-midnight"
  data-purpose="hero-section"
>
  <!-- Suspended Lima Star Accent -->
  <div
    class="absolute top-24 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 z-20 pointer-events-none select-none opacity-95"
  >
    <img
      alt="Estrella Lima"
      class="w-full h-full object-contain filter drop-shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(204,255,0,0.35)]"
      src={starLima}
    />
  </div>
  <!-- Big Chromatic Sphere at Right with Inset Text -->
  <div
    class="absolute -right-20 sm:-right-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[520px] h-[520px] sm:w-[600px] sm:h-[600px] lg:w-[660px] lg:h-[660px] rounded-full z-10 pointer-events-none select-none flex items-center justify-center p-12 text-center"
    style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 70% 30%, rgba(255, 107, 122, 0.95) 0%, rgba(158, 59, 66, 0.9) 35%, rgba(45, 20, 35, 0.92) 70%, rgba(8, 9, 13, 0.98) 100%); box-shadow: 0 0 120px rgba(255, 107, 122, 0.18);"
  >
    <div class="max-w-md px-6 text-center text-white/90">
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-balance text-neutral-200">
        Diseñamos y ponemos en producción sistemas de inteligencia artificial que automatizan tareas, convierten tus
        datos en decisiones y hacen crecer tu negocio con ROI demostrado.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Decorative Secondary Ambient Star Accent -->
  <div class="absolute right-[22%] bottom-16 w-12 h-12 z-20 pointer-events-none select-none opacity-40">
    <img
      alt="Estrella Secundaria"
      class="w-full h-full object-contain filter drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,107,122,0.4)]"
      src={starSecondary}
    />
  </div>
  <!-- Hero Content Container -->
  <div class="relative z-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 w-full">
    <!-- Top Pill Tag -->
    <div class="mb-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full frosted-pill">
      <span class="text-brand-lima text-xs">✦</span>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-lima font-medium"
        >INTELIGENCIA ARTIFICIAL APLICADA · QF 2026</span
      >
    </div>
    <!-- Monumental Editorial Title -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1
        class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.4rem] tracking-[-0.035em] font-light leading-[1.03] text-white mb-12"
      >
        IA que trabaja para <br />
        <span class="italic font-serif font-light text-brand-lima">tu empresa.</span>
      </h1>
      <!-- CTA Buttons and Microcopy -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-brand-lima text-brand-midnight font-bold text-sm tracking-tight hover:bg-brand-lima-hover transition-all duration-200 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 shadow-lg shadow-brand-lima/20"
          href="#contacto"
        >
          <span>Hablemos de tu reto</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </a>
        <a
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.08] text-white text-sm font-medium border border-white/10 transition-colors"
          href="/servicios"
        >
          <span>Ver los 12 servicios</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <!-- Social Proof Strip -->
      <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">
        <div class="flex -space-x-1 items-center">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-lima"></span>
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-coral"></span>
        </div>
        <span>4.9 Score de Operatividad · 100% Propietario</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- END: Hero Section -->
